      "message": "@timestamp now comes from emulated time: start_wall_time_us + sim_time_us + time_delay. That clock moves away                                                                                                                          from the wall clock: wait_usec only adds to sim_time_us, so events can land in the future or the past. Anything that    windows on @timestamp relative to now may drop them: Kibana\u0027s \"last N minutes\" and elk_stats_collect.sh:79-80, which    filters @timestamp to now-Nh .. now.",
